{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01857","headline":"杂曲歌辞 长干行 · 张潮","name":"杂曲歌辞 长干行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壻贫如珠玉，壻富如埃尘。\n贫时不忘旧，富贵多宠新。\n妾本富家女，与君爲偶匹。\n惠好一何深，中门不曾出。\n妾有绣衣裳，葳蕤金缕光。\n念君贫且贱，易此从远方。\n远方三千里，发去悔不已。\n日暮情更来，空望去时水。\n孟夏麦始秀，江上多南风。\n商贾归欲尽，君今尚巴东。\n巴东有巫山，窈窕神女颜。\n常恐游此山，果然不知还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张潮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}